></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISOBE, ASAHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKAMOTO, CHIKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKARAGI, KAZUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUJI, KAZUTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TSUNEMI, YASUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>USAMI, MITSUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YAGI, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YASUNOBU, CHIZUKO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method of checking the authenticity of a sheet having visible information on it and including a built-in electronic circuit chip that information can be read from and written to. The method comprises the steps of encrypting the visible information on the sheet and storing it in the electric circuit chip, and comparing the visible information on the sheet with the information stored in the electric circuit chip to check the authenticity.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé permettant de vérifier l'authenticité d'une feuille portant des informations visibles et comportant une puce électronique destinée à la lecture et à l'écriture d'informations. Ledit procédé consiste à crypter les informations visibles sur la feuille, à les stocker dans la puce électronique, et à comparer les informations visibles de la feuille aux informations stockées dans la puce électronique de manière à vérifier leur authenticité.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>